.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH shiftpaper 1  shiftpaper 
.SH NAME
shiftpaper \- Set parallax wallpapers for the shiftpaperd daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshiftpaper\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set parallax wallpapers for the shiftpaperd daemon.
.PP
shiftpaper bakes a depth map for each image, points the daemon at it, and changes settings like the transition and how the cursor is followed. The config it writes lives at ~/.config/shiftpaper/config.toml.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
shiftpaper\-fetch\-model(1)
Download a depth model to bake with
.TP
shiftpaper\-set(1)
Bake an image and set it as the active wallpaper
.TP
shiftpaper\-slideshow(1)
Bake several images and show them in turn
.TP
shiftpaper\-transition(1)
Show or change how one wallpaper changes into the next
.TP
shiftpaper\-mode(1)
Show or change the cursor tracking mode
.TP
shiftpaper\-bake(1)
Bake a source image into a color + 16\-bit depth PNG pair
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
shiftpaper fetch\-model               Download the default depth model
shiftpaper set ~/Pictures/wall.jpg   Bake an image and make it the wallpaper
shiftpaper slideshow ~/Pictures      Show a folder of images in turn
shiftpaper transition portal         Change how wallpapers change
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
shiftpaperd(1)
.PP
The docs: https://github.com/CPritch/shiftpaper/tree/main/docs
